<title>USA: Big Foot Financial Corp Q2 Jan 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Big Foot Financial Corp Q2 Jan 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LONG GROVE, Ill. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net profit		   226   profit	    21</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net  loss		    298   profit	   106</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest six-month results include one-time after-tax charge of $617,000 due to the recently-enacted assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Big Foot Financial completed its initial public offering on December 19, 1996. No per-share data are presented.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
